A dedicated button turns off the microphones and any camera, and a visual indicator shows when a camera streams images or video to the cloud, Amazon said. Certain features require Alexa+, which is included with a Prime membership. </i> Other devices Amazon <a href="https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/devices/new-alexa-devices-2026">unveiled today</a> include an Echo Time alarm clock, an Alexa Photo Frame and the Echo Show 16.
		 	
