		<span id="title-186487448" class="story-title"> <a onclick="return toggle_fh_body_wrap_return(this);" href="//slashdot.org/story/26/10/28/199238/are-ai-execs-too-out-of-touch-to-build-for-the-general-public">Are AI Execs Too Out of Touch To Build For the General Public?</a> <span class=" no extlnk"><a class="story-sourcelnk" href="https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/28/ai-execs-may-be-too-out-of-touch-to-build-for-the-general-public/" title="External link - https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/28/ai-execs-may-be-too-out-of-touch-to-build-for-the-general-public/" target="_blank"> (techcrunch.com) </a></span></span>

		
		
